      "x1_note": "x1 is always fixed at 0 — central compartment empty at dose time",
      "x2_note": "IC mean set to x2*=s/d=6.67 so individuals start near immune equilibrium",
      "x3_note": "IC mean set below x3*=2.15 so effectors rise toward SS during simulation"
    }
